  "description": "Noah Harrington might not have been born with power or riches, but he was definitely born with talent. While breaking into Renée Academy to complete a request, he unleashes his wind magic against Illoise, an academy student. The headmaster offers Noah a chance to study at the academy after seeing his potential during the break-in. On the first day of school, a series of mishaps occur and Noah is given an ultimatum: study with Illoise or risk flunking. Will Noah be able to overcome the odds and show the nobles at school what he's capable of?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
